{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787047778482633002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"cinderlike-faulty-yucker","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"39f53361aa0e0df8fd0b35e955ba0ec4e57658a0e0811412d87f14a4ff03c589","event_uuid":"3ab308ff-3207-4bdf-be38-385d9ca5d48f","position":{"commit_sha":"9531779883b7977c7123bf87d6d7db02ef7360e6","position":"1787047761822012001-3ab308ff-3207-4bdf-be38-385d9ca5d48f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"ad5d1e86b7d0e628bae6d092cb4f70de95e0141e69d427727a314a799b34c678","event_uuid":"604ed2bf-a39a-409f-9aae-305cd65068a6","position":{"commit_sha":"f3fedfbda22e1540a3254c95902f696437baed9e","position":"1787047778482633001-604ed2bf-a39a-409f-9aae-305cd65068a6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787047761822012001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"604ed2bf-a39a-409f-9aae-305cd65068a6","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"79c6-eaf3-38af-4ce9"}],"description":"## Context\nThe rebar-debug construct sweep for `fibrous-fabulous-dungbeetle` found a fourth live instance of the same centralization regression. `reconcile_helpers.py` explicitly supports standalone file-path execution and bootstraps the shared sibling loader, but `_commit_binding_store_snapshot()` unconditionally executes `from rebar_reconciler import git_adapter`. `reconcile.py` loads the helper by path under the flat key `reconcile_helpers`, so the installed in-process environment may have no top-level package.\n\n## Runtime Evidence\nA fresh process with `find_spec(\"rebar_reconciler\") is None` loaded `reconcile_helpers.py` by file path and called `_commit_binding_store_snapshot(None, real_temp_repo, \"probe\")`. It deterministically raised `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named rebar_reconciler` at `reconcile_helpers.py:200` before its documented graceful-degradation logic could run. The module-level loader contract is documented at `reconcile_helpers.py:2-15,30-50`; the flat by-path caller is `reconcile.py:60`.\n\n## Plan\n- Run rebar-debug independently to confirm the real production call path, defect legitimacy, and adapter identity requirements.\n- Add a RED oracle through the real standalone helper load and commit-back entry point.\n- Restore standalone-safe git_adapter loading with the canonical dotted cache key while preserving fail-open commit behavior.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A standalone-loaded helper reaches the documented commit-back behavior without package-path seeding.\n- [ ] Package-context and standalone execution share one canonical git_adapter module object.\n- [ ] Commit-back failures continue to degrade to False with the documented diagnostic instead of escaping.\n- [ ] Existing helper, bridge, and reconciler suites pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["reconciler","import","bridge"],"ticket_id":"cfe1-3572-4536-49d3","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Standalone reconcile helpers cannot import git adapter","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["3ab308ff-3207-4bdf-be38-385d9ca5d48f","604ed2bf-a39a-409f-9aae-305cd65068a6"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787047778482633002,"uuid":"d7acdd6b-9ab4-4f8b-88ed-58015bdbd72b"}